    "items": {
      "6.3": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **exact (1) `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Part (1) proves the actual q-dimensional paired determinant valuation -7q for every prime q≥5 and every q-integral rational X, with actual Beukers integral identification. Part (2) is refuted by an independently replayed exact h=4 negative direction; that replay is not Lean certification.",
        "missing": "Replace the false positive-cone construction and prove quantitative negative-tail control; preserve exact part (1) independently.",
        "source": "Theorem63Nonvanishing.lean"
      },
      "6.4": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **finite pencil/refutation components `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Actual surviving odd-square residues, partial fractions, positive slope and full real spectrum are verified for the rational pencil. The printed differential coupling is negative; an explicit corrected positive expression is proved. Actual beta integral calibration remains open.",
        "missing": "Repair and prove the actual monomial and simple-pole beta integral calibration; the corrected differential expression alone does not identify the claimed arithmetic coupling.",
        "source": "BetaOddPartialFractions.lean"
      },
      "6.5": {
        "status": "OPEN; **actual prerequisite components `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Actual integer quotient, odd-prime Euler-moment integrality and weight-4 pole norms are proved. The complete selected-prime Lagrange matrix and determinant valuation remain open.",
        "missing": "Prove actual tail-derivative units, prefix norms, integral unimodular Lagrange congruence and the full determinant valuation -(3m_q-2).",
        "source": "BetaOddPoleNorm.lean"
      },
      "6.7": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **exact (1) and cone refutation `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Actual multiweight rational pencil has slope CCᵀ, full degree h and all complex roots real for independent rational polynomials. Fixed-K positive/negative h-cones are impossible when 2h>K+1. Infinite Krein convergence and top-weight determinant remain separate.",
        "missing": "Repair the fixed-degree cone quantifiers, prove actual arbitrary-L² convergence and definite-subspace construction, and prove the independent top-active-weight determinant.",
        "source": "MultiweightHyperbolicity.lean"
      },
      "6.10": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **complete (2) `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Exact finite Hadamard bound and zero quadratic log growth are proved for actual independent integer polynomials, all real A≥0 and h=floor(lambda*K), with actual dual-slope identification. Part (1)'s equilibrium limits, strict reweighting and numerical ratio remain open or require repair.",
        "missing": "Establish actual equilibrium/potential limits and strict reweighting under exact hypotheses; repair the decay/height-ratio inference in part (1).",
        "source": "Theorem610CoefficientGrowth.lean"
      },
      "6.13": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **all-order analytic/Gram components `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Actual all-order differential identity, low-mode annihilation, positive exponential envelope, all moments and literal rational-kernel Gram positivity are verified. Printed series needs (-1)^(k-1); infinite-series and beta-functional/slope identification remain open.",
        "missing": "Justify the corrected differentiated infinite series, identify the coupled beta functional and its derivative, and prove the actual non-scalar condition for strict Newton inequalities.",
        "source": "SecantGram.lean"
      },
      "6.14": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **odd-prime unit refutation `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "The displayed r=1,e=2 moment is -25/256 with v_5=2, refuting the universal valuation-zero assertion. Scaling/Jacobian and functional normalizations still conflict.",
        "missing": "Choose and prove one consistent scaled beta functional/measure normalization; replace universal unitness by a justified integrality statement and derive the actual coupled spectral bounds.",
        "source": "BetaScaledUnitObstruction.lean"
      },
      "6.15": {
        "status": "OPEN; **analytic, rational-root/convergence components `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Actual all-k positive moments/minors are preserved. The actual pencil now has a unique rational root, correct parity side, exact inverse-Gram error, explicit polynomial error bound and convergence at fixed k,N. Euler/effective arithmetic and the printed stronger asymptotic remain open.",
        "missing": "Prove the exact all-order Euler evaluation and effective arithmetic bounds, and the claimed geometric asymptotic with its polynomial prefactor. Preserve eta(1)=log 2 separately.",
        "source": "BetaOddRootConvergence.lean"
      },
      "6.16": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **refutation and corrected cutoff `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Actual H_26^(beta,2) has v_7=-4, refuting the unrestricted -2 bound. The all-order repair 2M≤p^(a+1) ⇒ v_p(H_M^(beta,s))≥-sa is proved. Actual mixed weights and global multiplier conclusions remain open.",
        "missing": "Use the explicit prime-power cutoff, separate small/large-prime estimates, and prove actual mixed-weight calibration, endpoint comparison and global multiplier rate.",
        "source": "Chapter6HarmonicCutoffBound.lean"
      },
      "6.17": {
        "status": "REPAIR; **fixed-degree/local refutations `!!` on PR39**",
        "reason": "Fixed-K positive/negative h-cones require 2h≤K+1; K=h=2 is impossible. Earlier q=11/q=41 proof-step refutations and corrected supports remain verified. Actual multiweight normalization, infinite Krein and full determinant remain open.",
        "missing": "Repair fixed-degree quantifiers and local prime windows; establish the actual combined moment identity, infinite signed decomposition and recomputed determinant.",
        "source": "Chapter6ConeDimensionObstruction.lean"
      }
